      "originalText": "1. c == 'x'  →  flip pen\n2. y += (c=='s') - (c=='w')\n   x += (c=='d') - (c=='a')\n3. pen down && inside board ?\n       cells[y*5 + x] = 1",
      "autoResize": true,
